WEBVTT

00:12:56.912 --> 00:13:00.537
But rather were the ones
who allowed themselves

00:13:00.871 --> 00:13:07.121
an extended period of what Bridges calls a
neutral zone, could be several months,

00:13:07.121 --> 00:13:10.912
could be years of not knowing
where we're headed.

00:13:17.037 --> 00:13:21.996
The Neutral Zone. So here's how William
Bridges describes his concept in

00:13:21.996 --> 00:13:24.579
a video he made before his death in 2013.

00:13:25.371 --> 00:13:28.287
Phase two of transition
is the neutral zone.

00:13:29.246 --> 00:13:31.996
Most organizations don't even
have a name for it,